The recorder format note is attached to the records copy. Please do not
open the raw dump in a spreadsheet and save it again; that converted half
the time fields on the last job.

Numeric fields are little endian, but the four-byte control words are
byte strings. For the archive latch they are copied exactly as stored,
not reversed to make the display look familiar. The pressure field beside
them is context only. CRC failures are expected in the damaged tail and
must be ignored even when they have a higher sequence number.

The node we want is 0x31. The similar recorder on the other bench is 0x32.
Both appear in the mixed export. The route sheet carries the event and
freeze window; the paper chart's local clock was one hour ahead of UTC.

Simon
